The original project README describes DOTS as one of the online trajectory-compression algorithms, but only gives broad project-level usage guidance. It says that the original DOTS program historically needed to be run through Qt Creator/Qt IDE rather than a command-line interface. The adapted command-line wrapper is the important source for this repository’s benchmark workflow.

## Actual built binary

The built binary found in the repository is:

