# 3. Our streaming algorithm: `simplify`

## Source and build target

The implementation is:

```text
/Users/sinchunyeung/Simplification-of-Trajectory-Streams/simplify.cpp
```

The top-level CMake target is:

```23:29:/Users/sinchunyeung/Simplification-of-Trajectory-Streams/CMakeLists.txt
add_executable(simplify
  simplify.cpp
)

target_link_libraries(simplify
  CGAL::CGAL
)
```

The current binary found in the repository is:

```text
/Users/sinchunyeung/Simplification-of-Trajectory-Streams/build-release/simplify
```

A clean build is:

```bash
cd /Users/sinchunyeung/Simplification-of-Trajectory-Streams
cmake -S . -B build-release -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
cmake --build build-release --target simplify -j
```

## Defaults

The exact defaults in `simplify.cpp` are:

```20:24:/Users/sinchunyeung/Simplification-of-Trajectory-Streams/simplify.cpp
double DELTA = 200;
double EPSILON = 0.5;

bool out_flag = false;
bool dist_flag = false;
```

Therefore:

